*
!app/
!config/
!requirements.txt
# The model ./deploy.sh stages here just before the build. If it is not in the
# context, the Dockerfile cannot copy it in.
!.byggvekter/
app/logs/
app/__pycache__/
app/*.tar
# Leftovers from the old weights submodule. The weights come from .byggvekter/.
app/weights/
# The paddle models are downloaded in the Dockerfile. If they are in the build
# context too they get copied on top, and the image carries them twice —
# ~139 MB of extra disk per image, for nothing.
app/PP-*/
